# Pinned versions and SHA-256 checksums of the tools tests/lint/lint.sh downloads, so local runs and CI use the same
# releases. Sourced by tests/lib.sh; make validate checks that every tool has all four checksums. Checksum keys are <tool>_SHA256_<os>_<arch>, as detect_os_arch names them.
